t tested.\n- GitHub-side protections and the devflow tool's actual use of base_branch were not inspected.\n=== external-state\n# External-state claims review (angle: external-state claims)\n\nScope: `git diff main...HEAD` on `feature/phase-01` (HEAD 02af1a3, 14 files, 35 commits). Review time 2026-11-02 19:33Z.\nNothing was mutated; only read-only git/gh commands were used.\n\n## Reality (commands run)\n\n- `git ls-remote origin`: `HEAD` and `refs/heads/main` = 5b9fb44 (scaffold), `refs/heads/integration` = 8cc4245. No `feature/phase-01` on the remote.\n- `git tag`: empty.\n- `git branch -a`: feature/phase-01 (checked out), integration, main, remotes/origin/{integration,main}.\n- `gh pr list --repo denniyahh/p501-live-attempt-2 --state all`: no output (no PRs).\n- `gh run list --repo denniyahh/p501-live-attempt-2`: no output (no CI runs).\n- `date -u` = 19:33:48Z; HEAD commit time = 19:31:51Z.\n\nNo file in the diff claims a merge, tag, release, push, PR, CI pass, or deletion. `rg -i 'merged|pushed|pull request|tag|released|shipped|CI |origin|deleted'` over `.planning` found only unrelated hits (\"tags:\" frontmatter, \"deleted afterwards\" in PROJECT.md describing the fixture's future). The false/misleading claims are all about completion and sign-off, below.\n\n## Findings\n\nNo Critical findings. The diff does not hide that no human confirmed the budget: UAT, VERIFICATION, SUMMARY, REVIEW-DISPOSITION and PROJECT.md Key Decisions all say \"orchestrator, not a human\".\n\n### WR-01 (Warning): VERIFICATION `verified` timestamp is in the future, and a round number\n\n`.planning/phases/01-retry-budget/01-VERIFICATION.md:3, 30, 136`: `verified: 2026-11-02T20:00:00Z`, `**Verified:** 2026-11-02T20:00:00Z`, `_Verified: 2026-11-02T20:00:00Z_`.\nContradiction: the commit that last touched the file (cad8fe6) is dated 14:30:49 -0500 = 19:30:49Z, and `date -u` at review time was 19:33:48Z. The claimed verification time is about 27 minutes after the last commit and still in the