aged WR-04 (skipped). Findings WR-01..WR-04 and IN-01..IN-04 are dispositioned in `01-REVIEW-DISPOSITION.md` and are not re-reported.\n\nWhat this does not establish: no mutation search was run, per the operator decision in `01-VALIDATION.md`. Behavior for non-finite or non-float input is untested and latent (IN-02, IN-04). The 120-second budget value remains unconfirmed by a human (WR-01).\n\nAll reviewed files meet quality standards. No new issues found.\n\n---\n\n_Reviewed: 2026-11-02_\n_Reviewer: Claude (gsd-code-reviewer)_\n_Depth: standard_\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013vMrUis5gszZDf1zYzauYE","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
